+and both earlier checkpoints remain intact.
+
+Move all public command routing, argument validation, watching, retry, exit
+policy, game-cache decisions and subprocess construction into apps/chibi.
+Install that package with the SDK. The native chibi_main.c only resolves the
+application/core resources, starts the ordinary application host and returns
+its Main result. Remove the private Run entry, runner.* pack and compiler --run
